<title>PHILIPPINES: Crown Equities 1996 net 62 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Crown Equities 1996 net 62 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crown Equities Corp said its net income soared to 62 million pesos in 1996 from the previous two million pesos.</p>
<p>The firm said in a disclosure to the Philippine Stock Exchange its total assets more than doubled to 1.77 billion pesos last year from the previous 413 million.</p>
<p>It said its board has approved plans for the company to acquire real estate property and develop it into leisure and residential communities.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-89-36, fax 817-62-67</p>
</text>
